      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="1901_AS_RBH_1_00035"/>Hrn Dr. <hi rend="latintype">Richard
                     Beer-Hofmann</hi></addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb1110">
                     <hi rend="latintype">Villa Arnstein</hi>
                  </rs></addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb44278">
                     <hi rend="latintype">Pörtschach</hi> am Wörtherſee</rs></addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="image">
            <p rend="center">
               <pb facs="1901_AS_RBH_1_00034"/>
               <hi rend="pre-print">
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb180">Mirabellgarten in Salzburg</rs>.<space unit="chars" quantity="3"/>(<rs type="person" ref="#pmb50795">J.
                     Forster</rs>).</hi></p>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline>
                  <pb facs="1901_AS_RBH_1_00034"/>
                  <date>25. 6. 901</date>
               </dateline>
            </opener>
            <p>Herzlichen Gruſs. Ich fahre heut, ich will heute nach <hi rend="latintype">
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb867">Innsbruck</rs>
               </hi> fahren. Schreiben Sie doch eine Zeile (<rs type="place" ref="#pmb50">Wien</rs>)</p>
            <closer>Ihr<signed>A.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
